The brainstorming and ideation phase is where we define the problem, understand users, explore possible solutions, and decide what FitBuddy-AI should become before starting development.

1. Problem Identification
Many people want to exercise but struggle with:

Not knowing which exercises to perform

Following generic workout plans that don't match their goals

Lack of access to personal trainers

Difficulty adapting workouts to available equipment

Losing motivation after a few weeks

Not knowing how to progressively increase workout difficulty

Difficulty maintaining a consistent schedule

Problem statement:

Users need an affordable and personalized fitness planning system that can generate workouts according to their individual goals, fitness level, schedule, and available equipment.

2. Proposed Solution
FitBuddy-AI is an AI-powered fitness plan generator that uses Gemini models to create personalized workout plans.

The system asks users about their fitness profile and generates an appropriate plan.

