6. Gemini's Role
Gemini can be used for:

Understanding natural-language fitness goals

Generating structured workout plans

Explaining exercises

Suggesting alternatives

Adapting workouts based on user feedback

Generating progress summaries

Conversational fitness assistance

The application should keep important deterministic functions—such as workout history, completion percentages, streaks, and stored user data—in the application/database rather than relying on the model.

