8. MVP Idea
For the first version, avoid trying to build everything.

MVP
Login/register

Fitness profile

Goal selection

Gemini-powered workout generation

Weekly workout display

Exercise details

Workout completion

Basic progress tracking

Then later add the AI chatbot, adaptive plans, nutrition features, and other advanced functionality.

9. Expected Outcome
The final system should allow a user to go from:

"I want to get fit, but I don't know where to start."

to:

"FitBuddy-AI has created a workout plan that fits my goal, experience, equipment, and schedule."

This gives you a clear foundation for the next phases: requirements analysis → UI/UX design → system architecture → Gemini integration → development → testing.


